================================================================================
Bundled assets

Files shipped with birta and birta-core that do not come from a crate:
stylesheets, colour values, icons and the syntax and colour themes.
birta's own logo, favicon and other assets are not listed.
KaTeX and Mermaid are loaded by the browser from a CDN and are not bundled.

